ref":"../interfaces/WebSocketStreamInit.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"WebSocketStreamInit"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TOffset"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"toffset","text":"TOffset","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"socket","text":"socket","level":3},{"id":"request","text":"request","level":3},{"id":"init","text":"init","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction toWebSocketStream<TOffset>(\n   socket, \n   request, \n   init): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:120](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L120)\n\nRun a full-duplex, conversation-scoped chat over an already-accepted server\nsocket. Each inbound RunAgentInput frame starts one chat() turn (via onRun)\nwhose chunks are pumped back as frames; the socket stays open across turns\n(pending client-tool resubmit, next user message) until the client closes it\nor the idle timeout fires. An abort control frame aborts only its turn.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TOffset\n\n`TOffset` *extends* `string` = `string`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### socket\n\n[`WebSocketLike`](../interfaces/WebSocketLike.md)\n\n### request\n\n`Request`\n\n### init\n\n[`WebSocketStreamInit`](../interfaces/WebSocketStreamInit.md)\\<`TOffset`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: toWebSocketStream\ntitle: toWebSocketStream\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction toWebSocketStream<TOffset>(\n   socket, \n   request, \n   init): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:120](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L120)\n\nRun a full-duplex, conversation-scoped chat over an already-accepted server\nsocket. Each inbound RunAgentInput frame starts one chat() turn (via onRun)\nwhose chunks are pumped back as frames; the socket stays open across turns\n(pending client-tool resubmit, next user message) until the client closes it\nor the idle timeout fires. An abort control frame aborts only its turn.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TOffset\n\n`TOffset` *extends* `string` = `string`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### socket\n\n[`WebSocketLike`](../interfaces/WebSocketLike.md)\n\n### request\n\n`Request`\n\n### init\n\n[`WebSocketStreamInit`](../interfaces/WebSocketStreamInit.md)\\<`TOffset`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n"}
